      "dimension": "venue_fit",
      "title": "MSR 2027 full-paper scope and contribution",
      "statement": "An MSR 2027 Technical Papers Full Paper should make software data central, present a significant research contribution, and describe a new technique or novel research result with high technical rigor and scientific evaluation.",
