      "authority_class": "reporting_design_overlay",
      "dimension": "scientific_validity",
      "title": "ACM SIGSOFT Repository Mining Standard essential attributes",
      "statement": "For quantitative studies that automatically extract software-repository data, justify method fit, sources, repository selection, acquisition, preprocessing, measures, and any sampling or annotation procedure; validate selection criteria and measures where applicable; and discuss external-validity threats and method-specific boundaries.",
